<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Corp - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Corp - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.60 trln	 vs	    8.17 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   27.43		vs	   23.11</p>
<p> Current	     40.16		vs	   25.11</p>
<p> Net	   loss 212.12		vs     prft 8.23</p>
<p> EPS	   loss 199.28 yen	  vs     prft 7.73 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Corp is a major general trading company.</p>
</text>
